<title>UK: Syria tenders to sell 100 kt fuel oil in February. [Corrected 17:45 gmt]</title>
<headline>Syria tenders to sell 100 kt fuel oil in February. [Corrected 17:45 gmt]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Syria has tendered to sell 100,000 tonnes of high sulphur fuel oil for delivery in February, traders said on Monday.</p>
<p>(Corrects from &quot;buy&quot; to &quot;sell&quot;.)</p>
<p>The tender, which closes on Tuesday, was for two 50,000 tonne cargoes of fuel oil with a maximum sulphur content of 3.5 percent. While the cargoes are to be delivered in February, dates were not specified precisely.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 8167</p>
</text>
